{
  "Name": "Christmas_Santa",
  "$Comment": [
    "Santa's conversation, everything he says while Christmas runs, wherever his placement stands him (the",
    "Forgotten Temple, unless a server owner moves him). He contracts everything: I'm, you'll, they're.",
    "",
    "HOW A SCREEN IS PICKED. Start is walked in a fixed order: First (top to bottom), then a quest that is",
    "READY to hand in, then one he can OFFER, then one that is ACTIVE, then Then, then Fallback.",
    "First holds seven things. The off-season line comes first and shows only while Christmas is off (a",
    "visit after a command ends it, or a server owner who stands him somewhere all year), and its only",
    "answer is goodbye. Then his arrival line, for a player carrying his intro quest (Meet Santa,",
    "christmas_santa_meet, which arms itself while Christmas runs): its answer marks him greeted and hands",
    "that quest in, and since its pay is a Claim, the hand-in takes the player to his quest list with",
    "Collect in front of them. Then his Christmas Morning line, for a player carrying Christmas Morning",
    "(christmas_morning, which arms itself from December 25): its answer hands it in. Then his first words,",
    "for a player he has not met and who came without the intro: what happened to his sleigh, what to do",
    "about it and where, kept until the player answers. Then his first quest's offer",
    "(christmas_present_thieves), once (OnceId christmas_meet_thieves_offer), for a player who has handed",
    "the intro in and not taken that quest yet: collecting the intro plays this conversation again, so the",
    "story opens straight after the arrival. Then his daily word, once a day (Once with Period Daily,",
    "turning over at midnight UTC) and skipped while the player has something to hand in, in two wordings",
    "sharing one OnceId: after this year's Christmas Eve it says the story is done until next year and",
    "sends the player to the dailies, the thieves and the stalls; before it, the plain one. Either pays a",
    "little favor on his Nice List when the player finishes the line, whichever way they leave it.",
    "",
    "Quests holds one row per quest of his: the intro, the story's two steps that are his (Present Thieves",
    "and Christmas Eve), Christmas Morning, the carol tour, then his two dailies, so the story wins a tie",
    "with a daily. The helpers' steps (Reindeer Food, Christmas Cookies, Wrapping Presents) and their",
    "dailies are theirs, in their own conversations. Extra Thieves (christmas_extra_thieves) repeats with",
    "no limit, so its row names only its Active and Ready screens: with no Offerable beat the ladder never",
    "opens on it as an offer, and it is offered from his quest list (What needs doing?) instead. Then shows",
    "the after-Eve line once this year's Christmas Eve is done (it reads ON_COOLDOWN until it comes back",
    "next year, so the line takes that state beside COMPLETED).",
    "",
    "THE PRESENT HAND-INS. Christmas Eve, Daily Presents and the Present Job take a present by hand: the",
    "player holds a Christmas Present, looks at the character and uses it",
    "(Item/Interactions/Christmas/Christmas_Present_Give.json), so the brief screens say how.",
    "",
    "THE SEASON. A conversation has no Season leaf, so the off-season beat and the option that opens the",
    "stall read the feature ziggfreedcommon:feature Christmas_Live, Min 1: while Christmas is off the stall",
    "is not offered, and nobody is sent to a screen that opens closed.",
    "",
    "THE HELPERS. Where are your helpers? answers for the whole season in one line: Tomas and Elsie stand",
    "beside Santa, and while Harvest Feast's last days still run (they overlap the start of Christmas)",
    "they are at their feast spots by the kweebec village instead. A conversation gates a line only on its",
    "own season's switch, so the line names both places rather than asking which season runs. What can I",
    "help with? tells the story's order in one line, for a player who lost the thread.",
    "",
    "THE FOOTER. Most screens pull in the santa_footer group: hand-ins, the quest list (the Christmas",
    "Board's jobs included, since the board names him in Hosts), the stall (Santa's Stocking is on it, free",
    "once a day), How am I doing on the list? (it opens the Reputation page, and shows once the player has",
    "any favor with him), the Almanac (only while the Almanac is switched on), the story, three lore lines",
    "and goodbye.",
    "",
    "No line asks which world the player is in, so every line plays wherever he stands. The greeting's",
    "memory carries no Where, so it is kept once per player, the same in every world, and its",
    "ResetWithQuest files it under his intro quest (christmas_santa_meet): it is forgotten whenever that",
    "quest is reset, so a player who starts the story over hears his first words again."
  ],
  "Header": [ "ActiveObjective" ],
  "Memories": {
    "christmas_santa_greeted": { "ResetWithQuest": "christmas_santa_meet" }
  },
  "Start": {
    "First": [
      {
        "Node": "off_season",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "Not", "Of": [ { "Type": "Factor", "Factor": "ziggfreedcommon:feature", "Param": "Christmas_Live", "Min": 1 } ] }
        ]
      },
      {
        "Node": "meet_arrival",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "QuestState", "Quest": "christmas_santa_meet", "State": "ACTIVE" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "Node": "morning_arrival",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "QuestState", "Quest": "christmas_morning", "State": "ACTIVE" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "Node": "first_words",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "NotRemembered", "Memory": "christmas_santa_greeted" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "Node": "thieves_offer",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "QuestState", "Quest": "christmas_santa_meet", "States": [ "COMPLETED_UNCLAIMED", "COMPLETED" ] },
          { "Type": "QuestState", "Quest": "christmas_present_thieves", "State": "NOT_STARTED" }
        ],
        "Once": true,
        "OnceId": "christmas_meet_thieves_offer"
      },
      {
        "Node": "daily_word_story_done",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "Remembered", "Memory": "christmas_santa_greeted" },
          { "Type": "Not", "Of": [ { "Type": "HasReadyToTurnIn" } ] },
          { "Type": "QuestState", "Quest": "christmas_eve", "States": [ "COMPLETED", "ON_COOLDOWN" ] }
        ],
        "Once": { "Period": "Daily" },
        "OnceId": "christmas_santa_daily_word",
        "Actions": [
          { "Type": "Grant", "Rewards": [ { "Kind": "Reputation", "Params": { "Reputation": "Christmas_Nice_List", "Amount": 10 } } ] }
        ]
      },
      {
        "Node": "daily_word",
        "When": [
          { "Type": "Remembered", "Memory": "christmas_santa_greeted" },
          { "Type": "Not", "Of": [ { "Type": "HasReadyToTurnIn" } ] }
        ],
        "Once": { "Period": "Daily" },
        "OnceId": "christmas_santa_daily_word",
        "Actions": [
          { "Type": "Grant", "Rewards": [ { "Kind": "Reputation", "Params": { "Reputation": "Christmas_Nice_List", "Amount": 10 } } ] }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Quests": {
      "christmas_santa_meet": { "Offerable": "meet_arrival", "Active": "meet_arrival", "Ready": "meet_arrival" },
      "christmas_present_thieves": { "Offerable": "thieves_offer", "Active": "thieves_brief", "Ready": "thieves_ready" },
      "christmas_eve": { "Offerable": "eve_offer", "Active": "eve_brief", "Ready": "eve_ready" },
      "christmas_morning": { "Offerable": "morning_arrival", "Active": "morning_arrival", "Ready": "morning_arrival" },
